1
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,680
Shengli is here.

2
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:57,940
Have a seat.

3
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,320
No, thanks.

4
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:19,080
Mr. Teng, you seem quite leisurely.

5
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:21,520
Not bad.

6
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:24,200
I came here

7
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:25,820
just to ask you a question.

8
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:26,920
What is it?

9
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,400
About your Xiaohu,

10
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:29,320
are you not going to discipline him,

11
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,120
are you unable to discipline him,

12
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,520
or do you just not want to?

13
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:34,530
What do you mean?

14
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:52,370
It's just kids playing.

15
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,140
It's a fake gun.

16
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:55,920
Obviously fake.

17
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,320
Mr. Teng.

18
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,080
We've known each other for years

19
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,480
and know each other well.

20
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,280
You can't fool me with that.

21
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,320
Wang Hong is my guest.

22
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:07,600
Your Xiaohu was shooting at him with a gun,

23
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:08,520
and you're telling me it's fake?

24
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,520
Is it fake?

25
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:11,780
So what do you mean?

26
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:15,090
Are you here to interrogate me?

27
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,220
Do you want my life?

28
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:20,760
Who is this Wang Hong?

29
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,160
Your biological son?

30
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:26,760
Mr. Teng.

31
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:31,210
It wouldn't be too much to call you Uncle Teng,

32
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:34,930
because you worked hard with my father back then.

33
00:02:35,079 --> 00:02:37,480
I feel it's necessary to come and remind you

34
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,400
to keep your Xiaohu in check.

35
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,000
Don't touch Wang Hong again.

36
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,760
If something really happens,

37
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:45,420
you won't be able to handle it.

38
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:47,570
Keep it as a memento.

39
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,880
That bastard Teng Xiaohu

40
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,360
needs to be taught a lesson.

41
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:05,760
Hurry.

42
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,120
Hurry up.

43
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,560
Eat the noodles while they're hot.

44
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,600
Thank you, Third Aunt.

45
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:09,880
I added two eggs. Look.

46
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,520
Eat up to nourish yourself.

47
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:13,120
You're always busy with work

48
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,690
and don't eat properly.

49
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:16,240
You're even thinner than when you were a kid,

50
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,560
like a beanpole.

51
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,660
Look at these clothes.

52
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,320
Xiaolong,

53
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,079
you came back now

54
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,960
and still want to collect Korean pine.

55
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:31,290
Aren't you just making yourself a target?

56
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,720
With Teng Xiaohu making such a scene,

57
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,980
the police will definitely look for you.

58
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,160
That Cao Jin,

59
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:41,290
I've dealt with him before.

60
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,120
He may look easygoing on the outside,

61
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,600
but he knows exactly what's going on.

62
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:48,060
You need to think carefully about what to say when he finds you.

63
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,960
That's why I can't stay long.

64
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,800
If Cao Jin finds out I'm not at the hotel,

65
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:57,040
it will arouse even more suspicion.

66
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,930
Third Uncle, Ergui,

67
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,280
Lin Shengli and Li Zhijun,

68
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,360
I still need you to keep an eye on them for me.

69
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,690
Don't worry about that.

70
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,170
It's been so many years.

71
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:09,600
Any boss related to your family,

72
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:10,920
we've been watching them all,

73
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,320
every single one of them.

74
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,000
Stop running around.

75
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:16,360
What if Teng Xiaohu goes to the hotel to find you?

76
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,320
Just stay here.

77
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:19,320
Let your Third Uncle figure out the rest.

78
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,200
Third Aunt,

79
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,839
This is our trump card.

80
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:23,640
We absolutely cannot expose it.

81
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:26,200
Although the hotel is full of people,

82
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:27,600
sometimes,

83
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,130
the most dangerous place is the safest place.

84
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:31,640
Then you...

85
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:34,820
The kid knows what he's doing.

86
00:04:36,159 --> 00:04:36,760
Since you know what you're doing,

87
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,560
hurry up and put your clothes on.

88
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:42,240
Wait.

89
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,480
Take your Third Uncle's scarf too.

90
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:43,800
Hurry up.

91
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,560
No need.

92
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,880
Take it to block the wind.

93
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,760
One more thing.

94
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,280
Teng Xiaohu has run away now.

95
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:55,380
Teng Laohu will definitely act out of desperation.

96
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,930
We still need to be careful.

97
00:04:57,159 --> 00:04:59,240
Don't worry about us here.

98
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:01,200
Call if anything happens.

99
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,330
We are always ready.

100
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,560
I'll head back first.

101
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,720
Don't worry.

102
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,040
Xiao Ma.

103
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,480
He's awake.

104
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:24,040
Liu Ming's phone records

105
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,010
have been pulled up.

106
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,720
Liu Ming's phone records for the past week.

107
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,159
Look.

108
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,040
These are the victim's

109
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:43,400
phone records for the week before his death.

110
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,440
Two from Xinchun,

111
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:45,640
one from Jiangcheng.

112
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:47,320
Jiangcheng.

113
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:50,440
This Jiangcheng number called frequently,

114
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:52,370
but they were mostly missed calls.

115
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,200
As for me,

116
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:54,840
I called back the numbers on this list.

117
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:55,970
Many didn't answer.

118
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:59,380
SIM cards aren't registered with real names nowadays.

119
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:03,160
Any clues on Teng Xiaohu's end?

120
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:04,520
Not yet.

121
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:07,370
The forest police are also helping to search.

122
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,640
Go check his social network

123
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:13,280
to see where else he might go.

124
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:14,010
Understood.

125
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:15,000
Right.

126
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,940
Let's go stake out Teng Laohu.

127
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:18,700
If he has nowhere to go,

128
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,760
he might go to his dad.

129
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:25,800
Going out?

130
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,530
Officer Liu.

131
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,810
Zhou Guangfu's autopsy report

132
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:30,800
is basically consistent with the deductions from the scene.

133
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,530
The fatal wound is on the chest.

134
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:33,800
By the way,

135
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,480
someone sent you a package.

136
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,480
There's no sender's name.

137
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,740
I brought it up for you.

138
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:40,400
No sender's name?

139
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,680
Just a name.

140
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:43,600
Okay.

141
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:44,640
I'll leave you to it.

142
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:46,400
I'll head out now.

143
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:48,610
Officer Liu.

144
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:49,880
This.

145
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:53,040
We found this at the Beishan Hunting Ground.

146
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,800
Especially these two arrowheads.

147
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:57,200
They are very similar to the murder weapon.

148
00:06:58,320 --> 00:06:58,800
Okay.

149
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,480
Compare them carefully.

150
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,480
I'll get back to work then.

151
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,940
Thanks for your hard work.

152
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,960
Who took this?

153
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,920
That's a tricky angle.

154
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,760
This means that in the Beishan hunting ground,

155
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:22,420
we are not the only ones there.

156
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,920
There are others.

157
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,120
No matter who took it,

158
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,760
his purpose

159
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:30,160
is to muddy the waters.

160
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,159
Who could it be?

161
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,920
Who it is,

162
00:07:44,159 --> 00:07:45,820
we have to find out ourselves.

163
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:51,480
Don't you think this Wang Hong is very strange?

164
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,040
The two recent cases

165
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:55,080
are inextricably linked to him.

166
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,240
Liu Ming

167
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:58,960
died in the hotel where he and Li Xuefei stayed.

168
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:00,880
Suddenly, Teng Xiaohu popped up

169
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:01,880
and shot him.

170
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,760
And the one who picked him up on a tricycle,

171
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:09,200
who is he?

172
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,610
Now that you mention it, it's true.

173
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,720
Didn't we say it before?

174
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,640
His family background is a mystery.

175
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:17,440
Maybe there's a story behind it.

176
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:20,200
Mining has started on the mountain recently.

177
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:22,920
Bosses from other places will come one after another.

178
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,480
Chief Zhou called me over this afternoon.

179
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,560
He said the bureau attaches great importance to these two cases

180
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:29,090
and asked us to solve them as soon as possible.

181
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,680
This Teng Xiaohu...

182
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:35,480
Then...

183
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,480
Let's go stake out Teng Laohu first.

184
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:38,080
Right.

185
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:40,000
Maybe if we catch Teng Xiaohu,

186
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,090
we can find some clues from him.

187
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:44,570
Let's go.

188
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,200
You scared me.

189
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,970
Did you find Xiaohu?

190
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,120
No, we didn't.

191
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,720
We checked the places he usually goes

192
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,980
and asked his friends.

193
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:08,720
We looked everywhere we could,

194
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,480
but nothing.

195
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,720
But the good news is,

196
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:14,370
the police don't have any news either.

197
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,880
Shooting rabbits wasn't enough for him.

198
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,210
He had to shoot a person.

199
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:20,280
Is that how you play with that thing?

200
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:21,680
Who knows?

201
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,160
Hui.

202
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:25,400
You've been with me the longest.

203
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:27,800
Even if you have to search all of Xinchun,

204
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,520
you must bring Xiaohu back

205
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:29,920
in one piece.

206
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,130
Understand?

207
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:33,040
Understood. I'll get on it right away.

208
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:33,680
Also,

209
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,900
look into that guy named Wang.

210
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,120
Find out what he was doing in Jiangcheng

211
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,920
before he came to Xinchun.

212
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:42,760
I have a feeling this isn't that simple.

213
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:44,490
Understood.

214
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:10,020
Should we follow them?

215
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:11,320
No.

216
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:13,720
They must be looking for Teng Xiaohu.

217
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:16,240
We'll keep an eye on Teng Laohu.

218
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:18,220
Make sure nothing goes wrong.

219
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,120
By the way,

220
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:23,480
any news on Bihu,

221
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,490
whom I asked you to check on?

222
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:29,240
Tell me about it.

223
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,080
I had someone check for two days,

224
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,280
but there's nothing.

225
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:33,760
His neighbor said

226
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:35,720
they heard noises in his house a few days ago,

227
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:36,760
but didn't see anyone.

228
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:38,360
He must have gone somewhere.

229
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,060
When did they hear the noises?

230
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:44,000
They... They said

231
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:47,200
it was the early hours of the day before yesterday.

232
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,840
I remember his mother

233
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,520
is in Xinchun.

234
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:58,120
He was raised by his mother alone.

235
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,980
He's a good son.

236
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:00,880
They must be in touch.

237
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:03,000
I'll go back and find the address.

238
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,880
When I find it,

239
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,400
you go and take a look.

240
00:11:06,160 --> 00:11:06,880
Okay.

241
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:10,280
I'll go give the guys at the bureau some instructions.

242
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,760
"Give them instructions"?

243
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:14,290
You act like you outrank me.

244
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:20,680
Uncle San.

245
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:24,320
If my brother's identity is exposed this time,

246
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:26,080
will Teng Laohu strike first?

247
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:28,130
After all, back then...

248
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:31,810
If he strikes...

249
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,320
If he dares to strike,

250
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:34,850
I'll fight him to the death.

251
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,890
As for what happened back then,

252
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,000
I deeply regret it.

253
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:51,480
You're the one who delivered the gas cylinder to Zhao Zhiguo's house, right?

254
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,120
It was me.

255
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,280
I brought it.

256
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:55,040
What's the filling?

257
00:11:55,040 --> 00:11:56,000
Pickled cabbage.

258
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,200
Should I put it inside?

259
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:57,560
No need.

260
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:59,640
Just let your brother handle it when he gets back.

261
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:00,880
Hurry home and eat.

262
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:02,290
Alright.

263
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:05,280
What kind of gas cylinder is it?

264
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:07,520
I mean, is it full?

265
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,600
It's not full.

266
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:10,960
San'er.

267
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:11,760
I'm here.

268
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:13,160
Brother Zhao, what's up?

269
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:15,880
I just want to boil some dumplings for the kids.

270
00:12:16,560 --> 00:12:17,800
Can you deliver a gas cylinder?

271
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,480
You should have told me earlier, Brother Zhao.

272
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,920
My cylinders were all brought from the provincial capital.

273
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:21,980
I'm out of them now.

274
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:24,040
An almost empty one is fine too.

275
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:25,000
I just need it for two meals.

276
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:25,640
Alright.

277
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:26,800
I'll spare some for you.

278
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:28,060
I can put one together.

279
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:28,890
Mr. Wang.

280
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:30,520
Where is the tank you spared for me?

281
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,450
It's over there.

282
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,600
There's not much left in this.

283
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:38,330
It's enough for just two meals.

284
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,580
Alright, I'm leaving.

285
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,000
It wasn't a full tank.

286
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:46,800
No.

287
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:49,200
When you delivered it to him,

288
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:52,020
did you notice anything unusual about the tank?

289
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:54,000
For example, the valve.

290
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,560
Was it open or closed?

291
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:58,320
The valve was definitely fine.

292
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,880
If there was an issue, all the gas would have leaked out.

293
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:01,940
The valve was fine.

294
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:05,720
It's just that the road was slippery.

295
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:06,840
I fell.

296
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,320
The cart flipped,

297
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:10,020
and the tank took a hit too.

298
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,000
The car flipped.

299
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:22,440
Where did it flip?

300
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:24,240
Right at Laohugou.

301
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:26,640
At that big downhill slope in Laohugou.

302
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:30,600
It's very close to that Menghu Processing Factory.

303
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,560
When the car flipped,

304
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,840
were there any witnesses?

305
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:38,160
I mean, were there any passersby?

306
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:39,720
There actually was one.

307
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:40,760
He even lent a hand

308
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:43,080
and helped me put the tank back on the car.

309
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:56,720
Thank you.

310
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:58,120
I'll do it.

311
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,320
What did that person look like?

312
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,640
Was he bald?

313
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:10,080
I couldn't see clearly.

314
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:11,040
It was cold back then.

315
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:13,680
He was wearing a mask and a hat.

316
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:15,740
So I couldn't see what he looked like.

317
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:16,930
He was wearing a hat.

318
00:14:17,560 --> 00:14:18,440
Are you sure about this?

319
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,280
He was definitely wearing a hat?

320
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:19,960
I'm sure.

321
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,840
I even took a special look at him at the time.

322
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:22,920
But he was covered up too tightly.

323
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:24,320
I couldn't see anything.

324
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,540
Come to think of it.

325
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,720
That person was waiting for me there on purpose.

326
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,380
He must have tampered with it.

327
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:32,600
He was clearly wearing the uniform of the Menghu Processing Plant.

328
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:34,800
Why didn't I see his face clearly?

329
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:36,120
Uncle.

330
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,560
Don't be like this.

331
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:41,560
Didn't you clear things up with my brother back then?

332
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:42,960
Besides, as for this matter.

333
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,160
It's not certain yet.

334
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:47,960
I haven't been able to figure it out for so many years.

335
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:50,800
I clearly delivered a tank that was almost empty back then.

336
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:52,520
How could it explode like that?

337
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:55,450
If you can't figure it out, then don't think about it.

338
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:58,240
Now that batch of wood has appeared again.

339
00:14:58,240 --> 00:14:59,560
My brother is back this time.

340
00:14:59,560 --> 00:15:01,960
He will definitely figure out what happened back then.

341
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,800
Teng Xiaohu is already like this.

342
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:05,400
I just want to see Teng Laohu.

343
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:07,240
Can he still sit still?

344
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:08,960
Ergui is right.

345
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:09,960
In your heart.

346
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:11,920
That knot has never been untied.

347
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:14,100
We can't do anything else anyway.

348
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:14,920
Since he's back.

349
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:16,450
We should just support him.

350
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:18,720
Back then, whether it was a man or a ghost.

351
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,520
Let's see what really happened.

352
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:26,640
Let's see.

353
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:31,800
Thank you. I'm leaving.
